Probe test (pasted into the pad if they stall at hint level 3):
assert merge_holds([[4, 7], [1, 2], [6, 9]]) == [[1, 2], [4, 9]]
(Skipping the sort and merging in arrival order swallows [1,2] into the [4,7] block (its start <= the running end looks like an overlap) and returns [[4, 9]]; sorting by start first is the crux.)

